{"id":"n81200-1-8","stage":3,"title":"쿵 · 咣","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81200-1-8-1","ko":"이게 무슨 소리니? 방금 밖에서 쿵 하는 소리가 난 것 같은데?","zh":"这到底是什么声音啊？我好像刚才听到外面有咚咚的声音。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리니?","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖에서","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쿵","meaning":"咣，砰","explanation":"쿵：咣，砰","readings":[{"term":"쿵","audio":"/audio/e065f3fb2fba3e6df792.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81200","senseId":"1","lemma":"쿵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"响起那样的声音；或发出那样的声音。","explanation":"하다：响起那样的声音；或发出那样的声音。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"30","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"越过线或界限的那边。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"e065f3fb2fba3e6d","term":"쿵","zh":"咣，砰","audio":"/audio/e065f3fb2fba3e6df792.mp3","entryId":"81200","definition":"又大又重的物体落在地或其他物体上，或与其碰撞发出的声音。","pronunciation":["쿵"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"响起那样的声音；或发出那样的声音。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"响起那样的声音；或发出那样的声音。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/917d4c813d1a1a490f23.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81200-1-8-2","ko":"나도 들었어. 어서 나가 보자.","zh":"我也听到了。快出去看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었어.","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가","meaning":"出，出去","explanation":"나가다：出，出去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"1","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出，出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间里移动到外部。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/09d5d6507f8cf76b543b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.947,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81200","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7737,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我也听到了。快出去看看吧。","这到底是什么声音啊？我好像刚才听到外面有咚咚的声音。","真的这样做就能瘦下来吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这到底是什么声音啊？我好像刚才听到外面有咚咚的声音。","真的这样做就能瘦下来吗？","我也听到了。快出去看看吧。"],"answer":2}]}
